                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "942e6f03-839a-3772-a86b-26e6312be909",
                        "entry_id": "666954f3-6b0e-338b-8a69-bbd7fbc762f6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A lewd person; a lecher."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a33d2e8-94df-4dc5-847e-eb8b8ec78b2e",
                                "sense_id": "942e6f03-839a-3772-a86b-26e6312be909",
                                "text": "By giving the priesthood an opportunity of poisoning the moral principle, corrupting the mind, and working on the passion of women, it has enabled them to indulge in sensuality, to play the lewdster with their female confitents, and to seduce many a girl and woman who came to confess and be absolved."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f545d67e-7e83-454e-b692-6968323ba107",
                                "sense_id": "942e6f03-839a-3772-a86b-26e6312be909",
                                "text": "This does not suggest that the Garter Hotel, Windsor, was the Grand Babylon of its day, but merely that Sir John had been behaving as a nasty old man: in short, as Mistress Page observed, he was 'a lewdster'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d53a738-f71e-45f5-b4d7-3a1f226d8ba7",
                                "sense_id": "942e6f03-839a-3772-a86b-26e6312be909",
                                "text": "He was a weakling, a lewdster: with him the line of kings started from IkshWaku became extinct."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d478748c-e795-4a5b-ae72-ad9c1951d3c5",
                                "sense_id": "942e6f03-839a-3772-a86b-26e6312be909",
                                "text": "Jackson said, “What a lewdster.” “This is totally bizarre,” Sheila said. “Let's show this tape to Ruth.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "697e5c03-f375-4cd9-a2c7-ba7f04489fa2",
                                "sense_id": "942e6f03-839a-3772-a86b-26e6312be909",
                                "text": "You are such a lusty lewdster, Giles. I sometimes think men think of little else but the ungirding of their loins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab199c13-a9be-4495-b322-73ddd80dce32",
                                "sense_id": "942e6f03-839a-3772-a86b-26e6312be909",
                                "text": "He has spent the last twenty years among coal miners, that's why he's such a lewdster.'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
